{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"Y\",\n    \"small\": \"X\",\n    \"core\": \"X\",\n    \"concise\": \"平\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：Y胜，整块大字保留了人物、动作和因果关系，单看大字也能理解每屏发生了什么；X只看高亮词时，部分屏幕需要把几个短语自行拼接才能恢复主要意思。small、core、fine：X的小字感受整体更贴近两人当下的相处，细节具体而且有辨识度；Y有些表达如“情欲、执念与对生的眷恋”“哪怕是最亲密的人，也没法陪你走进心里的每一个角落”显得抽象或泛化，容易把注意力带离亲密幸福与失去感这个核心。concise：平，两版都有大字与小字表达相近感受的情况，X的S11接纳喜欢一段也有重复，Y则有更多小感受和旁注回说相近内容，整体差距不明显。human：X胜，Y的“这份需要添负担”“喜欢得几乎藏不住想靠更近”“不知不觉被看出多在乎”“比起初怕添负担”“喜欢既已被看见”分别存在成分省略过度、搭配不顺或书面腔问题。load：X胜，虽然高亮短语数量较多，但每块短而且意群清楚，总体阅读量很小；Y的大块需要读完整句子，尤其S01、S05等短停留屏，连续出现的长块对扫读要求更高。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a760a225-5d1d-4f80-b329-47f253916ac5", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T215943243602Z", "elapsed_seconds": 295.047, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T22:04:38.309300+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b8d8dc65425003c530e1f63751b079e56d87f0f5110bbcbc2e8b705a88ca753a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatg